WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.140
Can’t you be careful?

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:12.120
Are you injured?

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.956
No but my bike has been damaged.

00:00:14.956 --> 00:00:16.806
It is okay, I have an insurance.

00:00:16.806 --> 00:00:18.542
Insurance? Show me the papers.

00:00:22.140 --> 00:00:22.981
Here bro!

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:28.375
It’s only for the third party and not own damage.

00:00:28.375 --> 00:00:29.602
This can’t be claimed.

00:00:29.602 --> 00:00:32.919
What? I know nothing of this bro.

00:00:32.919 --> 00:00:35.421
Ok I will tell. Want to listen?

00:00:35.421 --> 00:00:37.929
Ok but shall we sit and talk?

00:00:37.929 --> 00:00:40.600
Yes! You sit, I will get some water for you.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:44.344
We will buy a vehicle with insurance.

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.269
Let it be car or bike.

00:00:45.269 --> 00:00:49.327
There are two things- own damage &amp; third party.

00:00:49.327 --> 00:00:54.335
Own damage is not affecting anybody else but you alone getting injured or

00:00:54.335 --> 00:00:57.558
your bike getting damaged.

00:00:57.558 --> 00:00:58.854
This is own damage.

00:00:58.854 --> 00:01:02.334
You can claim insurance for this.

00:01:02.334 --> 00:01:05.591
If it was an accident with another vehicle,

00:01:05.591 --> 00:01:08.246
They would be affected.

00:01:08.246 --> 00:01:13.240
So you can use this third party insurance policy in your insurance 

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:17.554
and claim it for them too from the insurance company.

00:01:17.554 --> 00:01:22.080
If you are going on your vehicle and another person hits you with his vehicle

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:28.606
You can claim insurance from the third party policy through the other person for your damaged vehicle.

00:01:28.606 --> 00:01:32.203
This is the difference between own damage and third party policy.

00:01:32.203 --> 00:01:36.794
Your insurance policy has not been renewed for own damage

00:01:36.794 --> 00:01:39.562
But third party insurance is still valid for 3 years.

00:01:39.562 --> 00:01:42.719
That is why I told that you can’t claim for your bike.

00:01:42.719 --> 00:01:47.616
What bro? When I bought this bike, they said the insurance is for 5 years.

00:01:47.616 --> 00:01:52.628
Yes but it is for third party insurance. In that you still have 3 more years.

00:01:52.628 --> 00:01:56.864
Own damage is only for one year and you haven’t renewed it.

00:01:56.864 --> 00:01:58.925
Bad time!

00:01:58.925 --> 00:02:03.816
If I had renewed it, I could have claimed for my injuries too right?

00:02:03.816 --> 00:02:07.504
No! Own damage is only for the vehicle and not for you.

00:02:07.504 --> 00:02:13.608
If you need it for yourself, you should have applied a Personal Accident Policy.

00:02:13.608 --> 00:02:17.635
Personal Accident Policy is mandatory from January 1st, 2019

00:02:17.635 --> 00:02:22.801
for all new vehicles along with other insurance.

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:24.918
And for people who have bought before that,

00:02:24.918 --> 00:02:30.253
It is better to contact their insurance company and get a Personal Accident Policy.

00:02:30.253 --> 00:02:32.905
We can check whether we have applied for a Personal Accident Policy

00:02:32.905 --> 00:02:34.905
or not by seeing our insurance papers.

00:02:34.905 --> 00:02:39.183
The vehicle owner can cover up to 15 lakhs.

00:02:39.183 --> 00:02:45.087
If your vehicle is used for any of your family member,

00:02:45.087 --> 00:02:51.829
You can apply a Personal Accident Policy in their name.

00:02:51.829 --> 00:02:55.230
If your friends too use the same vehicle,

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:59.331
You can get a Personal Accident Policy ‘unnamed’.

00:02:59.331 --> 00:03:04.622
You can claim the insurance according to the injuries caused.

00:03:04.622 --> 00:03:06.062
Oh!

00:03:06.062 --> 00:03:16.189
But for third party insurance, it is both for the person and the vehicle.

00:03:16.189 --> 00:03:25.119
All this is regulated by IRDAI.

00:03:25.119 --> 00:03:29.699
They are the ones who fix the amount to be claimed for third party insurance.

00:03:29.699 --> 00:03:34.680
You can see in your insurance paper which has third party and OD.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:38.407
Oh! So own damage is only for the vehicle.

00:03:38.407 --> 00:03:41.987
If it is for us, we should get a PA policy.

00:03:41.987 --> 00:03:46.966
If it is for a third party insurance, it covers both for the person and the vehicle. Right?

00:03:46.966 --> 00:03:49.355
Yes! You have understood it very well.

00:03:49.355 --> 00:03:52.684
Now, see your insurance paper and tell me the details.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:04:01.862
It says Package policy- OD and third party insurance.

00:04:01.862 --> 00:04:04.658
Also, I have a PA policy too.

00:04:04.658 --> 00:04:08.420
You should have bought it after January 1st, 2019.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:12.087
How many years is it for OD and third party insurance?

00:04:12.087 --> 00:04:19.078
According to September 1st, 2018, third party insurance rules had been changed.

00:04:19.078 --> 00:04:23.109
For a car, third party insurance is compulsory for 3 years.

00:04:23.109 --> 00:04:27.558
For a bike, third party insurance is compulsory for 5 years.

00:04:27.558 --> 00:04:30.200
OD is for one year, minimum.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.576
Later you can renew it.

00:04:32.576 --> 00:04:36.918
It is not compulsory that you should get an insurance

00:04:36.918 --> 00:04:39.434
in the same showroom where you buy your vehicle.

00:04:39.434 --> 00:04:40.505
No one should compel you too.

00:04:40.505 --> 00:04:41.525
We must know this.

00:04:41.525 --> 00:04:44.764
What are the situations applicable for this insurance?

00:04:44.764 --> 00:04:49.661
It’s applicable for fire accidents, theft, damaged in any riots,

00:04:49.661 --> 00:04:55.900
Damage by natural disasters and terrorist attacks.

00:04:55.900 --> 00:05:00.212
Most importantly you can claim it for accidents.

00:05:00.212 --> 00:05:03.982
Oh! When is it not applicable?

00:05:03.982 --> 00:05:05.171
Not applicable.

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:14.380
Accident caused while driving without a license or drunk can’t be claimed.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:19.400
And accidents caused due to brake failures can’t be claimed too.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:26.837
Accidents caused while using your vehicles for any illegal activities can’t be claimed.

00:05:26.837 --> 00:05:32.080
So, if your vehicle is stolen, you should file a case immediately or you'll be in trouble.

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.080
Yes that’s right!

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:39.459
What is Insured’s Declared Value –Rs.36,000? 

00:05:39.459 --> 00:05:40.742
How do they calculate it?

00:05:40.742 --> 00:05:50.404
They would look at the vehicle’s condition, year, model and type and fix the rate for a year.

00:05:50.404 --> 00:05:52.561
This is IDV.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:57.960
You haven’t renewed your OD yet.

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:02.493
If you are going to renew it now and you haven’t claimed anything this year,

00:06:02.493 --> 00:06:09.147
You might get a discount of 20-50%. 

00:06:09.147 --> 00:06:12.547
This is called No Claim Bonus. (NCB)

00:06:12.547 --> 00:06:14.446
Next time when you go for renewal,

00:06:14.446 --> 00:06:19.429
check for NCB, PA policy.

00:06:19.429 --> 00:06:21.824
Right! I will see hereafter.

00:06:21.824 --> 00:06:23.533
Now my bike is damaged.

00:06:23.533 --> 00:06:24.634
How do I claim it?

00:06:24.634 --> 00:06:26.899
For that, you should have renewed it.

00:06:26.899 --> 00:06:29.300
Yes I know. If it was renewed how would I claim it?

00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:34.564
Then, take a picture of the injuries and damages caused to you and your vehicle.

00:06:34.564 --> 00:06:37.220
Send it to your insurance company.

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:38.438
They will see it.

00:06:38.438 --> 00:06:44.593
If the damage is minimal, you can leave it in the workshop and claim the money.

00:06:44.593 --> 00:06:47.863
If the damage is severe,

00:06:47.863 --> 00:06:52.363
they would send a surveyor to check after you send the pictures.

00:06:52.363 --> 00:06:57.479
The surveyor would check on the damage and note it.

00:06:57.479 --> 00:07:02.480
You can then get the vehicle repaired in a workshop or showroom.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:06.434
If you have a cashless service in your insurance,

00:07:06.434 --> 00:07:08.180
You need not pay.

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:11.981
The money will be directly given to the workshop or showroom.

00:07:11.981 --> 00:07:17.280
So, it is important to see whether you have a cashless service while getting an insurance.

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:19.223
This is how you should claim it.

00:07:19.223 --> 00:07:21.794
-Oh is it?
-Yes!

00:07:21.794 --> 00:07:25.183
If someone else hits me, how do I claim?

00:07:25.183 --> 00:07:30.438
You should get the insurance policy details from the other person.

00:07:30.438 --> 00:07:33.634
Then you must inform your insurance company and the police.

00:07:33.634 --> 00:07:34.540
They will take care of it.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:41.480
Now, if my third party insurance expires and I hit someone.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.187
How will the other person claim it?

00:07:43.187 --> 00:07:45.956
In critical situations like this,

00:07:45.956 --> 00:07:49.055
They would get the desired amount from you.

00:07:49.055 --> 00:07:57.009
They would claim the third party insurance which was paid earlier and give it to the affected.

00:07:57.009 --> 00:08:00.110
You don’t be without renewing.

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:02.815
Then you can’t even claim for OD.

00:08:02.815 --> 00:08:05.500
Yes I should renew it.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:06.946
Don’t forget all this.

00:08:06.946 --> 00:08:20.254
Tell all the points that we discussed now to everyone.

00:08:20.254 --> 00:08:22.722
Young people should definitely know it because

00:08:22.722 --> 00:08:28.880
the accidents taking place are worse.

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:31.509
Getting these policies are good.

00:08:31.509 --> 00:08:37.660
It is not our fault not to know this because no one taught us.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.688
This week is Road Safety Week.

00:08:39.688 --> 00:08:43.405
Wearing helmet on seeing the police is not road safety.

00:08:43.405 --> 00:08:49.952
Getting insurance, saving ourselves and others is good.

00:08:49.952 --> 00:08:54.528
So, renew your papers soon. Ok?

00:08:54.528 --> 00:08:56.526
Yes sure!

00:08:56.526 --> 00:08:59.669
Now only I understood well about insurance.

00:08:59.669 --> 00:09:01.834
I will share it with others.

00:09:01.834 --> 00:09:04.580
Shall I come with you to drop you?

00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:05.080
No I am alright bro.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:12.380
-Use your helmet.
-Ok bro!

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:13.364
Right!

